  "text": "\r\n\t\t Calendar • STATE GENERAL ELECTION - 2026 \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Living In... \r\n\t\t\t Explore \r\nHome \nCalendar \r\nCalendar\t   \r\nView All Calendars is the default. Choose Select a Calendar to view a specific calendar. Subscribe to calendar notifications by clicking on the Notify Me® button, and you will automatically be alerted about the latest events in our community.    \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t List \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Week \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Month \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  Find a Facility \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  Notify Me® \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  Print \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  Subscribe to iCalendar \nSearch Calendars by: \r\n\t\t Start Date \t\t \t\t \r\n\t\t End Date \t\t \t\t \r\n\t\t Enter Search Terms \t\t \r\n\t Show Past Events \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Select a Calendar \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Select Calendar/Calendars to filter \r\n            All Calendars\r\nAfrican American Committee\r\nCable Advisory Board\r\nEconomic Development Committee\r\nFire Department\r\nForestry Committee\r\nLocal Energy Committee\r\nMeetings\r\nNesmith Library\r\nPlanning Board, CIP, Conservation, & Zoning Board\r\nPolice Department\r\nRecreation\r\nSelect Board\r\nSupervisors of the Checklist\r\nTechnical Advisory Committee\r\nTown Clerk\r\nTown Events\r\nWindham Housing Authority\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Search \r\n\t\t   Return to Previous \r\nEvent Details \r\n         View Map \r\nGoogle \nBing \r\nDate: \r\nNovember 3, 2026 \r\n2026-11-03T07:00:00 \r\nTime: \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t7:00 AM - 8:00 PM\r\nTime Details: \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t7 AM - 8 PM\r\nLocation: \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t View Facility \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWindham High School Auditorium\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nAddress: \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t 64 London Bridge Road \nWindham ,  NH   03087 \r\nSTATE GENERAL ELECTION - 2026 \r\nTuesday, November 3, 2026 \r\nPlease bring your NH accepted picture identification to vote.  \nPlease bring your passport, birth certificate, naturalization papers and proof of domicile (such as a driver's license with your correct address) to register at the polls on election day. \r\n         Map \r\n        \t Agenda \r\n\t\t Facility \r\n\t\t Submit Event \r\n\t\t Print \r\n\t\t Email \r\n\t\t Event Subscription \r\n\t\t View RSS Feeds \r\n\t\t Select on Calendar \r\n\t\t Expand \r\n\t\t Collapse \r\n\t\t Previous \r\n\t\t Next \r\n\t\t Down \r\n\t\t Up \r\n\t\t Map \r\n\t\t Share \r\n\t\t Show more \r\n\t\t\t Agenda \r\nLive Edit \n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Building Permits \r\n\t\t\t Tax Assessments \r\n\t\t\t GIS Map & Property Info \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Windham \r\n3 North Lowell Road \r\nWindham, NH 03087 \r\n(603) 965-1201 \r\nOld Values, New Horizons \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Accessibility \n         Privacy Policy \n         Copyright Notices \n         Sign In \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
